Lemonade Tycoon is the original game represented by this browser port.
Original game names, artwork, audio, data, and code retain their original ownership
and notices. The in-game credits are preserved.

assets/Lemonade.RB contains the original resource bundle.
assets/cold-memory.bin contains the original program image used at startup.
engine/generated contains C translated from original program instructions.
